WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.968 --> 00:00:05.253 line:85%
Home starts with CONTINUE.

2
00:00:05.253 --> 00:00:07.537 line:85%
It opens the next stop on the Journey.

3
00:00:07.587 --> 00:00:15.594 line:85%
If no Journey stop is open, CONTINUE opens Word Quest instead.

4
00:00:15.644 --> 00:00:18.159 line:85%
TODAY is the daily list.

5
00:00:18.159 --> 00:00:20.674 line:85%
Your child goes down it, one task at a time.

6
00:00:20.724 --> 00:00:25.321 line:85%
After each task, a card offers Next task or Back to Home.

7
00:00:26.581 --> 00:00:30.858 line:85%
Stars show progress. Bronze: the word power is learned.

8
00:00:30.908 --> 00:00:34.374 line:85%
Silver: the chapter boss is beaten.

9
00:00:34.424 --> 00:00:38.474 line:85%
Gold: remembered later, in the Daily Raid.

10
00:00:39.737 --> 00:00:43.052 line:85%
Grown-up pages are under Me → Grown-ups.

11
00:00:43.052 --> 00:00:46.367 line:85%
Hold the button to open.

12
00:00:50.329 --> 00:00:56.940 line:85%
Daily time sets the pace of the Journey.

13
00:01:00.574 --> 00:01:03.025 line:85%
Pick minutes per day.

14
00:01:03.025 --> 00:01:05.476 line:85%
A stop still finishes only when it is mastered.

15
00:01:06.705 --> 00:01:09.175 line:85%
Sound, voice and motion are in Settings.

16
00:01:09.175 --> 00:01:11.646 line:85%
Mute here and how-tos stay quiet too.

17
00:01:16.334 --> 00:01:19.960 line:85%
Set a PIN to keep the grown-up pages private.

18
00:01:20.010 --> 00:01:27.159 line:85%
Every how-to guide can be replayed here.

19
00:01:29.411 --> 00:01:31.676 line:85%
Each guide shows one move on the real screen,

20
00:01:31.676 --> 00:01:33.940 line:85%
then hands it back.
